    "kind": "narration",
    "speaker": "NARRATOR"
   },
   "reviewed": {
    "kind": "narration",
    "speaker": "NARRATOR"
   },
   "changed": false
  },
  {
   "index": 36,
   "text": "“孔乙己长久没有来了。还欠十九个钱呢！”",
   "model": {
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speaker": "掌柜"
   },
   "reviewed": {
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speaker": "掌柜"
   },
   "changed": false
  },
  {
   "index": 37,
   "text": "我才也觉得他的确长久没有来了。一个喝酒的人说道，",
   "model": {
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speaker": "UNKNOWN"
   },
   "reviewed": {
    "kind": "narration",
    "speaker": "NARRATOR"
   },
   "changed": true
  },
  {
   "index": 38,
   "text": "“他怎么会来？……他打折了腿了。”",
   "model": {
