   },
   "changed": true
  },
  {
   "index": 41,
   "text": "“他总仍旧是偸。这一回，是自己发昏，竟偸到丁举人家里去了。他家的东西，偸得的么？”",
   "model": {
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speaker": "UNKNOWN"
   },
   "reviewed": {
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speaker": "酒客"
   },
   "changed": true
  },
  {
   "index": 42,
   "text": "“后来怎么样？”",
